NAME         HQ_MAP

DESCRIPTION 'Advanced Heroquest Map Generator'

CODE         PRELOAD MOVEABLE DISCARDABLE
DATA         PRELOAD MOVEABLE MULTIPLE

EXETYPE      WINDOWS

HEAPSIZE     4096
STACKSIZE    20480

IMPORTS
             KERNEL.INITTASK
             KERNEL.INITAPP
             KERNEL.WAITEVENT
             KERNEL.__AHSHIFT
             KERNEL.OUTPUTDEBUGSTRING
             KERNEL.GETPROCADDRESS
             KERNEL.LOADLIBRARY
;             KERNEL.LSTRCPY

